  "composition_rules": [
    "ready archetype instances use linked listing-card and mobile-rail resources",
    "desktop ready flow preserves chronological time groups; each group lays out one to three intrinsic-width linked card instances, and the untimed stress group proves a real three-card row",
    "state surfaces are semantic states, not hidden terminal overrides",
    "mobile date accessory is a linked fixed-position listing component above the linked shell bottom navigation; its date chips and calendar trigger remain linked semantic actions",
    "shell overlay owns stacking and safe-area offsets",
    "desktop and mobile are separate parent contexts at 759/720 boundaries",
    "sparse desktop is a bounded linked archetype variant: one specific-date header, one time-group header, one linked compact listing card, and one semantic Like-with-count proof; review boards only instantiate the archetype",
    "stress proof is two bounded sequential viewport slices, never one long review board: upper renders the first two chronological fixtures and continuation renders the remaining four including the three-card program row",
    "all shell icon masters live on Page 25; shell masters and review boards contain linked instances only",
    "fixture-bound ListingEventCard Compact masters live on Page 60.1b and nest linked media, content, social-proof and concrete medallion-frame variants; archetypes consume only card instances, never sibling slot overlays",
    "mobile listing head masters live on Page 60.1d: Page head and Feed head are separate native components, Feed head nests a linked City picker summary, and the exact review board contains linked instances only",
    "mobile rail correction is recursive: compare and correct Event summary, inline Like, media cells, Digest, identity/artifact slots and Like CTA independently before a track or viewport verdict; a parent screenshot never substitutes for these leaves"
  ],
